flowchart LR
    I[Input image] --> C[Frozen CLIP image encoder]
    I --> W[Multiscale structural consistency]
    C --> P[Patch feature grid]
    P --> S[External normal/abnormal semantic prior]
    S --> N[Normal witness discovery]
    W --> N
    P --> N
    N --> G[Intra-image normality grounding]
    P --> D[Patch evidence to be explained]
    G --> R[Intra-image normality anchors]
    R --> E[Reference-relative deviation]
    D --> E
    S --> A[Semantic anomaly evidence]
    W --> Q[Grounding reliability gate]
    A --> F[Grounded anomaly scoring]
    E --> F
    Q --> F
    F --> O[Final anomaly map]
